{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49192","headline":"广谪仙怨 · 康骈","name":"广谪仙怨","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"晴山碍目横天，绿叠君王马前。\n銮辂西巡蜀国，龙颜东望秦川。\n曲江魂断芳草，妃子愁凝暮烟。\n长笛此时吹罢，何言独爲婵娟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"康骈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49192.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49192","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}